      "content": "<p>Let A = {n <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.09ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.312ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -540 667 580\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2208\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2208\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> N : H.C.F. (n, 45) = 1} and</p>\n<p>Let B = {2k : k <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.09ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.312ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -540 667 580\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2208\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2208\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> {1, 2, ......., 100}}. Then the sum of all the elements of A <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.403ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -598 667 620\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2229\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2229\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> B is ____________.</p>",
      "options": [],
      "correct_options": [],
